<title>USA: St Paul hogs up $2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs up $2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Friday, prices were $2.00 higher. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	  220-250 lbs    50.50</p>
<p>			250-260 lbs    50.00-50.50</p>
<p>			260-270 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3	  270-280 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
<p>    Sows - steady/up $2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    43.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
